784
01:31:34,130 --> 01:31:36,670
Doing what lovers do.

785
01:31:39,900 --> 01:31:41,020
How?

786
01:31:45,330 --> 01:31:47,150
Want me to show you?

787
01:31:54,400 --> 01:31:56,120
I’m not stopping you.

788
01:37:52,170 --> 01:37:53,780
I’m going to remove my hand.

789
01:38:23,170 --> 01:38:24,180
So pretty!

790
01:38:31,130 --> 01:38:37,020
Fifteen years ago, I wanted to surprise you with a doll.

791
01:38:39,050 --> 01:38:45,480
But it turned out to be a memory that tore us apart.

792
01:38:49,370 --> 01:38:52,550
Today, I want to build a wonderful memory together with you.

793
01:39:07,770 --> 01:39:09,700
You’ve kept it all along?

794
01:39:14,600 --> 01:39:16,080
I’ve kept it for you.

795
01:39:35,270 --> 01:39:36,420
Thank you.

796
01:39:46,130 --> 01:39:50,980
You know what? When I got stuck in there,

797
01:39:52,300 --> 01:39:54,100
the only person I could think of was you.

798
01:40:07,270 --> 01:40:08,920
I love you, Phrao.

799
01:40:11,650 --> 01:40:18,920
I’m going to tell it to you every day…for the rest of my life.

800
01:40:22,330 --> 01:40:24,380
I love you too, Phi Jah.

801
01:40:25,330 --> 01:40:28,950
I’m going to say it until you get sick of hearing it.

802
01:40:31,530 --> 01:40:32,880
No way.

803
01:40:33,620 --> 01:40:37,320
I’m going to stay by your side and listen to it forever.

804
01:40:46,920 --> 01:40:51,920
♫I don’t know how to tell you how I feel♫

805
01:40:51,920 --> 01:40:58,420
♫I’m still confused by the way you react when I’m around♫

806
01:40:58,680 --> 01:41:03,220
♫I’m still afraid. Will it be all right if I say it?♫

807
